commits_info.message:
Remove redundant defaultAnswer(RETURNS_DEFAULTS)

`withSettings()` invokes `defaultAnswer(RETURNS_DEFAULTS)` as follows:

```
    public static MockSettings withSettings() {
        return new MockSettingsImpl().defaultAnswer(RETURNS_DEFAULTS);
    }
```

so, invoking it again is redundant.

This commit simply removes the redundant invocation.
